``dials.tof_integrate``: add ``method=profile_3d_profilelib``, ``profile_3d_ibix``'s iBIX x bivariate Gaussian model with the shape measured on strong reflections and held fixed elsewhere, as ``profile_1d_profilelib`` does for the ToF line shape. Weak reflections are fitted at their predicted position, strong ones with the position free.
``dials.tof_integrate``: add ``overlaps.mode``. ``mask`` keeps reflections whose bounding boxes overlap, masking the voxels they share, instead of rejecting them all; ``deconvolve`` also fits clusters of overlapped reflections jointly in 3D against the profile library. ``overlaps.estimator=joint`` fits every reflection with the same 3D model, so that all profile-fitted intensities come from one estimator. Both work with ``method=profile_1d_profilelib`` and ``method=profile_3d_profilelib``.
